{"id":"vod_bf_21041","vodId":"21041","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠超","name_cn":"龙珠超","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-22/f8c55be128f5502fa26820c5428bdc7c.jpg"},"summary":"结束了与魔人布欧的惨烈之战后，多灾多难的地球重归和平，而作为救世主存在的孙君（野泽雅子 配音）还生人间，和家人们过着无忧无虑的快乐生活。这边厢Z战士们安享太平，遥远的宇宙最深处，一个可怕的神明悠然苏醒。他是破坏神比鲁斯（山寺宏一 配音），嗜好美食又无比任性，稍有不满意的地方便面不改色地摧毁一颗星球以及上面的生命，堪称是界王神都不敢轻易招惹的可怕神明。受一个神秘之梦的侵扰，比鲁斯决定寻找强大的对手比试一番。他和随从维斯（森田成一 配音）来到了地球。孙悟空和伙伴们面临前所未有的挑战，而他将朝着神的境界全力冲刺……　　本片是由鸟山明担任原案所开启的全新的龙珠故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动作,动画,惊悚,奇幻,冒险,喜,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 07:14:07","classic":true,"classicRank":41,"franchise":"龙珠","playable":true,"episodeCount":131,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuchao/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhuc